  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="FR">Appui au renforcement des capacit&#xe9;s de la police nationale ha&#xef;tienne</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support to the capacity building of the Haitian National Police</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="FR">Ce projet vise &#xe0; renforcer la capacit&#xe9; de la Police nationale d&#x2019;Ha&#xef;ti (PNH) de participer &#xe0; des formations internationales en fournissant des services logistiques et un soutien pour comprendre la mise en pratique de la formation acquise. Les activit&#xe9;s de ce projet comprennent : 1) organiser le d&#xe9;placement des participants aux cours de la PNH, ainsi que l&#x2019;achat et l&#x2019;exp&#xe9;dition du mat&#xe9;riel de formation; 2) faciliter la pr&#xe9;paration et le traitement des documents de voyage; 3) fournir un soutien logistique sur le terrain selon les besoins; 4) examiner et analyser les retomb&#xe9;es de la formation internationale afin de soutenir les efforts visant &#xe0; &#xe9;laborer les prochaines formations.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project supports the abilities of the Haitian National Police (HNP) to participate in internationally-led training through the provision of logistical services and support to understand the usage of training acquired. Project activities include: (1) organizing HNP course participant travel, as well as the procurement and shipping of training materials; (2) facilitating the preparation and processing of travel documentation; (3) providing on-the-ground logistical support as required; and (4) reviewing and analyzing the effect of internationally-led training to support efforts to shape future training.</narrative>
  </description>
